B.ZJ=new A.nC("01","Set the camera side-on","Place the phone close to perpendicular to the run-up, on the bowling-arm side. Front or rear views cause foreshortening and joint overlap.",null)
B.ZI=new A.nC("02","Keep it still","Use a tripod or rest the phone on something solid. Hand shake blurs the arm at 240 fps.",null)
B.ZL=new A.nC("03","Fit the whole action","The bowler should stay fully in frame from arm horizontal until after release.",null)
B.ZH=new A.nC("04","Use good light","Bright, even light keeps 240 fps frames sharp. Avoid filming into the sun.",null)
