B.X7=new A.bH("movx finds two moments in the delivery: Arm Horizontal (AH), when the bowling upper arm is level, and Ball Release (BR). It scans the whole clip with a small pose model, then measures about 150 frames around the delivery with a larger one, and a temporal model trained on labelled 240 fps deliveries picks the AH and BR frames. Elbow extension comes in a later version.",null,B.iN,null,null,null,null,null,null)
